{"author":{"id":"2f242a7e7f2592f8909954a77fabece74f6e8cc197182647ed3b15ea8e3878af"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790960761,"nonce":"2WlGwGrEhFCV/1uHNDqeyy9gDTk=","title":"build x-idl from a pinned revision, not the sibling checkout","message":"The workspace patches x-idl to `../x-idl`, because the x-idl it needs (library names, nested variants, the wire's queue, the HashLink Bytes layout) was only on a local branch. Those commits are on x-idl's main as 05fe9cf5e27a4e31a91e2a6f8aecfdad7604fc10, not yet pushed. CI checks out xwindow alone, so `cargo test --workspace` fails there until the pin moves.\n\nOnce x-idl's main is pushed: set `x_idl`'s `rev` in Cargo.toml to it, drop the `[patch.\"https://github.com/rayzor-blade/x-idl.git\"]` section, and refresh Cargo.lock.","files":null}]}